-- ==================================================================
-- COCOON v3.3 — Concurrent Hold/Place/Eject worker pool
-- - 2 workers (game cap: 2 held objects)
-- - holdWithRetry: verifies pickup actually succeeded, retries until
--   the server accepts (pet no longer busy on food/drink)
-- - Per-furniture dwell times (food/drink longer)
-- - Guaranteed eject on stop/error
-- ==================================================================
